      "content": "the problem is i already asked and they gave me this super vague corporate answer about \"improving employee wellness.\" it felt scripted. i'm not even sure i can trust them to be honest about where the data is going. also, if i try to \"contact the supplier\" like you said, won't that just flag me as someone who's being difficult or suspicious? i'd rather just find a way to confuse the sensors or something so i can work in peace without feeling like i'm being watched 24/7.",
